+**#999/#1000/#1003/#1005/#1006/#1008** (new since `92a201a26`):
+- `3188d03cd` `-Wint-to-pointer-cast` and `-Wcompare-distinct-pointer-types`
+  (registry rows, emission, sign-compare type suffix, `-Wformat=` labels,
